{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Werewolves Revenge is a <strong> social deduction </strong>game where your <strong>voice</strong> is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Played by up to <strong>16 Players</strong>, games are filled with deceit, murder and plot twists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/Town.png?t=1741461098\" />\u00a0<strong>Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Identify and eliminate the hidden werewolves through discussion and voting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/Werewolf.png?t=1741461098\" />\u00a0<strong>Werewolf</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secretly eliminate villagers each night and try to blend in during the day to avoid detection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/Neutral.png?t=1741461098\" />\u00a0<strong>Neutral</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See to your own unique objectives or win condition, independent of the Town and Werewolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/Evil.png?t=1741461098\" />\u00a0<strong>Evil</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oppose the Town and Werewolves, creating a complex dynamic of competing factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/LesserEvil.png?t=1741461098\" />\u00a0<strong>Lesser Evil</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Align with both the Werewolves and Evil roles against the Town, forming a unified antagonistic force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Example Roles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/Sorceress.jpg?t=1741461098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/AlphaWolf.jpg?t=1741461098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/StormMage.jpg?t=1741461098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/Roles.jpg?t=1741461098\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Proximity Voice Chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character Customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player Housing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Locations for Secret Meetings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Werewolf Cave</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1867320?t=1741461098","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1867320?t=1741461098","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/124529151b060ea1668670b9e4c025c996357ee4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741461098","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/124529151b060ea1668670b9e4c025c996357ee4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741461098","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Werewolves Revenge is a <strong> social deduction </strong>